@SophiaCai99 reports that the White House and Anthropic are collaborating to create a formal technical assessment framework. This framework aims to quantify the severity of AI jailbreaks and establish a standardized methodology for evaluating similar incidents in the future. It reflects an understanding that no AI model can be completely immune to hacking.

The goal is to develop a common set of benchmarks to assess future jailbreaks, including how safeguards were bypassed, the capabilities exposed, and the practical consequences of breaches, with input from @cheyennehaslett.

